{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Earth. The &quot;S.T.A.R.&quot; (Space and Time Anomalie Researcher), detected something on the Moon...</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Something powerfull that needs to be investigated.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>We weren't prepared for that... They came from the depths of the void...to conquer.\u00a0</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Envolve yourself with your believes in this RPG Action/Adventure to discover what is behind this anomalie...</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>...And save the Earth!!!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Astral Destiny is na Adventure/Action, Sci-fi, Fantasy RPG game created with the RPGMaker MZ.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">It's an Adventure game with turn-based battles based in the rpg maker game concept.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You play as John the STAR Laboratory Chief Security who will travel to the Moon, to retrive a Time-Space anomaly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">That strange object will reveal some powers like Psionics that will help you through the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">At the same time, a powerfull enemy from a distant galaxy discovers Earth and wishes to conquer it, due to the rich materials on it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your mission will be to discover the secrets of the object, and with that knwoledge defeat </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">K'raan the Artnoc Emperor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3651670/extras/Gameplay.gif?t=1744728777\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3651670?t=1744728777","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3651670/a1e923a42a636f3a1a7120c60c2a4e7a9715ca11/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1744728777",