</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">That strange object will reveal some powers like Psionics that will help you through the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">At the same time, a powerfull enemy from a distant galaxy discovers Earth and wishes to conquer it, due to the rich materials on it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your mission will be to discover the secrets of the object, and with that knwoledge defeat </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">K'raan the Artnoc Emperor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3651670/extras/Gameplay.gif?t=1744728777\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","developers":["Jos\u00e9 Gata"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3651670/d3817dc114f273e1acd7f74e4aaa206c41c3c79f/header.jpg?t=1744728777","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257126318,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257126318/movie480.mp4?t=1744728775","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257126318/movie_max.mp4?t=1744728775"},"name":"Trailer2","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257126318/9bcb35c39f0148889927ec3d12ed610a2cf3e8b9/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1744728775","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257126318/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1744728775","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2